Q: How can I force div contents to stay in one line without changing display to inline? A: <p>Use <code>white-space:nowrap</code> and <code>overflow:hidden</code></p>
<p><a href="http://jsfiddle.net/NXchy/8/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">http://jsfiddle.net/NXchy/8/</a></p>
<p><div class="snippet" data-lang="js" data-hide="false" data-console="true" data-babel="false" data-babel-preset-react="false" data-babel-preset-ts="false">
<div class="snippet-code">
<pre class="snippet-code-css lang-css prettyprint-override"><code>div {
  border: 1px solid black;
  width: 70px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
}</code></pre>
